---
title: Where your data lives
description: Where nullish runs, where your data is stored and who handles it.
sidebar:
  label: Hosting
---

Your accounting data is stored and processed in Switzerland.

## Server

nullish runs on its own server at [Infomaniak](https://infomaniak.com), in Switzerland.

## Encryption

The server's disk is encrypted, and all traffic goes over HTTPS.

## Backups

Backups are made every night, encrypted before they leave the server, and stored in Switzerland with a separate provider. A problem at one company can't take out both the app and its backups.

## Email

Notifications, such as sign-in verification, are sent through Amazon Web Services ([SES](https://aws.amazon.com/ses/)), from its Zurich region (`eu-central-2`).

## AI assistant

The AI model runs at Infomaniak, in Switzerland. Your questions, and the books the assistant reads to answer them, stay in the country.

## Website

The website runs on a separate server. Its [analytics](https://yetanotherwebanalytics.dev/) are self-hosted on the same machine and anonymized.

## Access

Only the nullish team can access the servers, and only with a hardware security key.

The accounts at our providers are protected with two-factor authentication.

## Status

Check whether nullish is up, and see past incidents, at [nullishstatus.com](https://nullishstatus.com).
